name: The Hook — discard punishment
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Hook discards 2 random cards from your hand after every played hand. Ante 1 boss:
  build around small hands or high-value plays; Luchador/Chicot disable it.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: TheHook
    antes: [1]
should:
  - joker: Luchador
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Chicot
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Acrobat
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
